urier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">patient_traj &lt;-<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/trajectory.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/trajectory.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3afO4loP5iOiXT7gQwZc3A\">trajectory</a></span>(name = <span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;patient_trajectory&quot;</span>) %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/set_attribute.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/set_attribute.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0KxdHqi546Ll_XrPo0MjYW\">set_attribute</a></span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;resource&quot;</span>, function() <span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\">sample</span>(1:3, 1)) %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/select.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/select.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GsilvBM8s5V54Ql67FF4v\">select</a></span>(resources = function(attrs) <span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\">paste0</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;doctor&quot;</span>, attrs[<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;resource&quot;</span>])) %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/seize.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/seize.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0z_rSnHa0GWlDcqXIN56Dj\">seize_selected</a></span>(amount = 1) %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/timeout.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/timeout.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mIu-3oqX87J7UyBHuFqa_\">timeout</a></span>(5) %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/seize.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/seize.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0z_rSnHa0GWlDcqXIN56Dj\">release_selected</a></span>(amount = 1)\r\n\r\nenv &lt;-<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/simmer.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/simmer.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WScohAE-5YEg_HmqF0k3j\">simmer</a></span>() %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/add_resource.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/add_resource.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CxXn3jujwZa7GvyGYLQ1J\">add_resource</a></span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;doctor1&quot;</span>, capacity = 1) %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/add_resource.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/add_resource.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CxXn3jujwZa7GvyGYLQ1J\">add_resource</a></span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;doctor2&quot;</span>, capacity = 1) %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/add_resource.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/add_resource.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CxXn3jujwZa7GvyGYLQ1J\">add_resource</a></span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;doctor3&quot;</span>, capacity = 1) %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/add_generator.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/add_generator.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0crHrbtlJ4ixeii79UV3Ep\">add_generator</a></span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">&quot;patient&quot;</span>, patient_traj, <span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/at.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/at.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aWipMUFafXVyak0lM6GMD\">at</a></span>(0, 1, 2), mon = 2) %&gt;%\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(3,106,7)\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/run.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/run.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0y4X38uRHHGKm0hmEZXrlH\">run</a></span>()\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102)\"><a href=\"http://r-simmer.org/reference/get_mon.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(55,95,132);background-color:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-simmer.org/reference/get_mon.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467911955000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QaJgaxuxSiIgzZF71AKv_\">get_mon_attributes</a></span>(env)</code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10.5px;padding:10px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);overflow:auto;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;word-break:normal;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0px\"><code style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">============================================================</code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10.5px;padding:10px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);overflow:auto;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;word-break:normal;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0px\"><code style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\">produces the following error:</code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10.5px;padding:10px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);overflow:auto;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;word-break:normal;word-wrap:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0px\"><code style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><pre style=\"border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in UseMethod(&quot;select_&quot;) : \r\n  no applicable method for &#39;select_&#39; applied to an object of class &quot;c(&#39;trajectory&#39;, &#39;R6&#39;)&quot;</span></pre></code></pre><pre style=\"margin-bottom:10.5px;padding:10px;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(238,238,238);overflow:auto;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;word-break:normal;word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:0px\"><code style=\"font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-radius:0px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><pre style=\"border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;;outline:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:16px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Why is that? How does simmer know that this is not select() from package dplyr?</pre></code></pre></div></div>"
